		(uuid "0c95b831-55be-5f60-b2d1-68a299f5561f")
	)
	(text "OFF: the connector reaches only the FPGA user pins (CW305 behaviour).\nJTAG: the capture device drives the FPGA TAP (SCK = TCK, MOSI = TDI, PDID = TMS, MISO = TDO);\n      the FT4232H JTAG buffers are disabled by CW_JTAG_SEL_N. TDO reaches MISO through 220R:\n      keep the FPGA pin on CW_MISO an input in designs used this way (up to 15 mA otherwise).\nSERIAL: slave serial (SCK = CCLK, MOSI = DIN, PDID = CS_B, PDIC = PROGRAM_B;\n      TIO3 = INIT_B, TIO1 = DONE, TIO4 = READY through 1k). Only with M[2:0] = 111.\nSet the selector to OFF after configuration.\nThe buffer enables are the nets CW_JTAG_SEL_N and CW_SER_SEL_N (labels at the buffers)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 114.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "611f2de1-00cb-5c07-b48b-13448238e72a")
	)
